    {
      "id": "BjtzztTSNNXYbMG_DtkUo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1028.7753425031924,
      "y": 484.036712333759,
      "width": 773,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "GP70OGLk1LNa_oX1yKq8H",
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 578668604,
      "version": 272,
      "versionNonce": 100691418,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786538518227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果插入的数据是有序的，BST 会退化成链表，导致查找效率变为 O(n)\n只有当 BST 是“平衡的”(树的高度 ≈ log₂(n))时，查找、插入、删除操作才是 O(log n)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果插入的数据是有序的，BST 会退化成链表，导致查找效率变为 O(n)\n只有当 BST 是“平衡的”(树的高度 ≈ log₂(n))时，查找、插入、删除操作才是 O(log n)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6ikke_99dPEbZ3LzKjDM9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1035.7753425031924,
      "y": 236.036712333759,
      "width": 468,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "GP70OGLk1LNa_oX1yKq8H",
      "index": "aRV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1082535740,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 719942854,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786538518227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n操作        最佳情况        最差情况（退化为链表）\n查找        O(log n)        O(n)\n插入        O(log n)        O(n)\n删除        O(log n)        O(n)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n操作        最佳情况        最差情况（退化为链表）\n查找        O(log n)        O(n)\n插入        O(log n)        O(n)\n删除        O(log n)        O(n)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
